# Real finite study through the form. Only the deterministic secret scanner runs.
name: Study form, explicit allowance, separate launch and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
require-live-snap: 20 TOOLS | selected-module
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | selected-options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-form
expect: Discovery passes
expect: set explicitly
expect: L next
ask: Does the form make the repository, three-pass default, single worker and explicit allowance understandable?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | prepared-study
expect: No jobs started
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART/draft-check.json draft
keys: Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Source content | frozen-context
expect: Git SHA
expect: explicitly omitted
expect: Exact scan options
ask: Can the operator inspect the source identity and actual frozen scanner context before approval?
resize: 80x24
live-snap: study-80
ask: Is the source detail readable with visible paging at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: study-60
ask: Does the stacked layout retain selection and useful source detail at 60x20?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: study-40
expect: Source and context
expect: Esc back
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 fixed. | study-40-paged
ask: At 40x12, can the operator read the complete source/context receipt without losing the controls?
resize: 96x89
live-snap: study-tall
ask: Does the tall layout keep the form coherent and its next action clear?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: study-wide
ask: Does the wide layout use list/detail space well without stretching text excessively?
resize: 40x12
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Total calls | calls-editor
type: 9
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Protected review | review-editor
type: 3
keys: Enter Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 Next action | next-step
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval-first-page
keys: y
live-snap: approval-before-reading
expect: Read remaining terms
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last-page
ask: Are the complete plan terms readable before an explicit approval, even in the smallest supported terminal?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-study
expect: Open approved jobs
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART/approved-check.json approved
resize: 120x36
live-snap: approved-status
expect: 0 committed / 9 total
expect: 3 protected review
ask: Does approval return to the study with durable consumption and a separate Open approved jobs action?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 L starts its fixed jobs | jobs-before-launch
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART/unstarted-check.json approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 dispatcher pid | dispatcher-started
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART/finished-check.json finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 completed 3 / planned 3 | completed-study
expect-not: 0 findings
ask: Does the job view truthfully show the outcome of exactly the three approved deterministic passes?
keys: C-c
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restart
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | restored-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 0 committed / 9 total | restored-allowance
expect: 3 protected review
ask: After restart without color, are the same plan and allowance available directly without searching Logs?
keys: Escape C-c
